"}', 'kb-doc-09-mitre-attack-p0-3468', 0, 122, '09-mitre-attack', 'retrieved', 'C24BF96DBF8D82897239D84A7BB7248776F855AF06B1B3849A05E469E0CD0E71', 'v1', '{"source_id": "09-mitre-attack", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "STRUCTURED_DATA"}')
