Linux"], "x_mitre_version": "1.0"}', 'kb-doc-09-mitre-attack-p0-3695', 0, 126, '09-mitre-attack', 'retrieved', '02E1B5A4224D29BD7E90B6DF6624B78E43CD54A80109FEA03327A5B7025C28CE', 'v1', '{"source_id": "09-mitre-attack", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "STRUCTURED_DATA"}')
